@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777

### Create a Clasificacion first
POST {{baseUrl}}/clasificaciones
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "lugarInicio": "Cartagena",
  "precio": 500,
  "fechaDisponibilidadInicio": "2025-10-05T10:00:00",
  "fechaDisponibilidadFin": "2025-12-20T20:00:00",
  "capacidadMaxima": 100
}

### Create an Item (valid) - assuming clasificacion ID is 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Hotel en Cartagena",
  "descripcion": "Un hotel cómodo en Cartagena",
  "fechaPublicacion": "2025-09-26",
  "stock": 50,
  "visualizaciones": 0,
  "calificacionPromedio": 0,
  "clasificacionId": 56
}

###

### Get the Item by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/53
Accept: application/json

###

### Update the Item
PUT {{baseUrl}}/items/53
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "titulo": "Hotel en San Andrés",
  "descripcion": "Un hotel lujoso en San Andrés",
  "fechaPublicacion": "2025-09-26",
  "stock": 30,
  "visualizaciones": 100,
  "calificacionPromedio": 4,
  "clasificacionId": 1
}

###

### Delete the Item
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/items/53

###

### Try to get deleted Item (should return 404 or equivalent)
GET {{baseUrl}}/items/53
Accept: application/json
